### exec binds only to the second name branch
find . -name '*.wav' -o -name '*.au' -exec rm {} +
>>> SC2146 1:38

### grouped second branch with the action
find . -name '*.wav' -o \( -name '*.au' -exec rm {} + \)
>>> none

### alternation without an action
find . -name '*.wav' -o -name '*.au'
>>> none
